CROSS-CHECK, absorbed + ADL against build 2's backstop_liq_usd (flow table, same day): the ratio of absorbed alone to backstop_liq_usd is 0.52 on 2025-10-10
(2.2562e9 / 4.3595e9), but absorbed + ADL = 2.2562e9 + 2.1033e9 = 4.3595e9, equal to the flow table's 4.3595e9; likewise 2025-07-10 (6.6449e6 + 3.5143e5 = 6.9963e6),
2025-11-12 (2.8234e7 + 2.1271e7 = 4.9505e7), 2026-04-08 (1.6857e7 + 8.932e6 = 2.5789e7) and 2025-08-26 (0 + 1.2283e8). So the flow table's backstop_liq_usd counts BOTH real backstop
liquidations (absorbed by a vault wallet) and auto-deleveraging trades (whose bankrupt side also carries a "Liquidated..." dir). ADL T3 totals equal the flow table's adl_usd on all 14 days.
